      "✏️s/🔌️plugins/🧱️block/🗿️artifacts/◻️2d/🏅️standards/🔖️1/🪆️subsets/✳️any/🚪️io/🧪️tests/🧩️suite/🟦️.ts",
      "✏️s/🔌️plugins/🧱️block/🗿️artifacts/🧊️3d/🏅️standards/🔖️1/🪆️subsets/✳️any/📚️examples/🏢️nakagin-capsule/🧪️tests/🧩️example/🟦️.ts",
